omarchy-rivian
==============

This plugin is a port of omarchy-tesla by Jankees van Woezik, MIT licensed:

    https://github.com/jankeesvw/omarchy-tesla
    Copyright (c) 2026 Jankees van Woezik

Carried over essentially unchanged:

    MapView.qml                 tile rendering, marker, attribution
    bin/rivian  cmd_map         Web Mercator tiling arithmetic
    bin/rivian  fetch_tile      tile cache
    bin/rivian  cmd_place       Nominatim reverse geocoding and its cache

Carried over and adapted:

    Panel.qml                   panel layout, wording, bar states, test hooks

Written for this plugin:

    bin/rivian                  everything else — Rivian's GraphQL gateway,
                                its login and OTP flow, the vehicle-state
                                query, and the mapping from Rivian's wire
                                format onto the panel's reading
    RivianMark.qml              the bar mark
    manifest.json, tests/

Field names for Rivian's undocumented app API came from the community's
unofficial documentation at https://rivian-api.kaedenb.org/ and from
rivian-python-api (https://github.com/the-mace/rivian-python-api), Apache-2.0.
No code from either is included here.

